WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.350
In old cartoons, a whistle blew at five, and everyone went home.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.500
The desk stayed at the office.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.150
So did the boss.

4
00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:18.650
The man drove past the same white houses and was in his chair before the music ended.

5
00:00:19.675 --> 00:00:21.775
Dinner was on the table.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.825
Somebody's feet went up.

7
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.975
Nobody checked anything.

8
00:00:28.845 --> 00:00:30.975
There was nothing to check.

9
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.100
Somewhere along the way, five o'clock stopped meaning anything.

10
00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.400
The office learned to ride home in your pocket.

11
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.550
So tonight, blow your own whistle.

12
00:00:46.775 --> 00:00:49.650
Put the phone in a drawer, and go home.

13
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.450
Even if you're already there.
